        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    euro_amount = 200_000 * 90\n    initial_six_month_forward_ask = 1.3983 - 19.0 / 10_000\n    current_three_month_forward_bid = 1.4106 - 21.6 / 10_000\n    usd_libor = 0.01266\n    remaining_years = 3 / 12\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    termination_value = (\n        (current_three_month_forward_bid - initial_six_month_forward_ask)\n        * euro_amount\n        / (1 + usd_libor * remaining_years)\n    )\n    answer = round(termination_value, 1)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
